%let Fancy = (props: { children?: unknown }) => @mark[id: "fancy"]{@(props.children)};

A dynamic tag whose expression is a component: @(Fancy){highlighted}.

@Definition[id: "nota", label: "Nota", tooltip: "A document language."]{Nota} is defined here;
the reference &nota pops a tooltip after hydration.

%let Counter = () => {
  let [n, setN] = createSignal(0);
  return @button[id: "counter", type: "button"][onClick: () => setN(n() + 1)]{n=@n};
};

@Counter{}

